WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:13.294
"June!" Pip says. "You came back!"

2
00:00:13.296 --> 00:00:18.506
June sobs and does not reply.

3
00:00:18.507 --> 00:00:24.594
Jane looks shy. "Don't cry, June.

4
00:00:24.595 --> 00:00:26.866
I'm sorry I was rude.

5
00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:30.995
I want to help Sweet Land now."

6
00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:36.770
"It's too late," June says sadly.

7
00:00:36.771 --> 00:00:44.775
"Why?" Pip rubs his chin.

8
00:00:44.776 --> 00:00:50.773
"The duke got the queen," June says.

9
00:00:50.774 --> 00:00:57.474
"He put a spell on her.

10
00:00:57.475 --> 00:01:03.293
Now she sleeps and sleeps."

11
00:01:03.295 --> 00:01:09.288
Pip gasps. "The duke is bad!"

12
00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:16.391
"Sweet Land is unhappy now," June says.

13
00:01:16.392 --> 00:01:22.310
"The duke made sticky slime spots all over.

14
00:01:22.311 --> 00:01:28.191
He wants to make Sweet Land yucky."

15
00:01:28.192 --> 00:01:32.241
"We will catch him!" Pip says.

16
00:01:32.242 --> 00:01:35.961
"We will put him in chains!"

17
00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:44.341
Jane makes a fist. "We have to try."

18
00:01:44.342 --> 00:01:49.505
"It will not be easy," June says.

19
00:01:49.506 --> 00:01:57.597
Just then the game shakes.

20
00:01:57.598 --> 00:02:02.225
A slime hand pops out and grabs June.

21
00:02:02.226 --> 00:02:07.181
"June!" the kids cry.

22
00:02:07.182 --> 00:02:11.458
The slime tugs her back to the game.

23
00:02:11.459 --> 00:02:17.284
June can't get free.

24
00:02:17.285 --> 00:02:20.931
"I am weak when the queen sleeps.

25
00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:25.182
This is all I can do for you."

26
00:02:25.183 --> 00:02:34.476
She waves her wand at the kids. Zap!

